{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/560731-the-new-beast-forum","id":560731,"title":"The New - Beast: Forum","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-06-19T06:37:00-07:00","id":560731,"title":"The New - Beast: Forum","content":"I know that beast has not been completed yet, but I see lots of threads about it and I fell that it should now (since kickstarter has reached its first goal) should get its own forum. I am not aware of the process it would take or the time line required to make such a thing happen, but if someone could put in a estimate of effort and time it would take to open a new forum for Beast.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Like the Sun I am relentless even in death...","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3293-rahod","name":"Rahod","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-19T07:54:26-07:00","id":560833,"title":"","content":"Probably not until the Kickstarter is over, and even then it might be a while.<br /> Creating a forum reduces sales and hype.<br /> Out of sight, out of mind.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2447-twitchtherat","name":"TwitchTheRat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2447_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-19T08:00:22-07:00","id":560841,"title":"","content":"Really? I thought putting all the Beast threads in one location would increase awareness and bring more attention as it would be easier to see the collective discussions in one location rather then watching them flow onto further pages and then lost as most people only read first to third pages into the forums.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Like the Sun I am relentless even in death...","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3293-rahod","name":"Rahod","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-19T08:04:00-07:00","id":560849,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rahod</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/560731-the-new-beast-forum?p=560841#post560841\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Really? I thought putting all the Beast threads in one location would increase awareness and bring more attention as it would be easier to see the collective discussions in one location rather then watching them flow onto further pages and then lost as most people only read first to third pages into the forums.</div> </div> </div> </div>Nope!<br /> <br /> At some point it will need to happen for organizational reasons, but as soon as it gets its own forum hype will diminish.<br /> Literally out of sight, of mind. They probably won't risk it until after the kickstarter is done, at least.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2447-twitchtherat","name":"TwitchTheRat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2447_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-19T08:45:20-07:00","id":560883,"title":"","content":"If the general forum is full of Beast threads, people who otherwise would just not go to the Beast forum have to notice those Beast threads even if they don't open them. It keeps Beast on the mind. So, what Twitch is saying basically.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Revlid wrote:<br /> Yes, hollowing out your humanity to become an utterly utilitarian asura is the exact suggestion I would expect from you, Aiden.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/168-aiden","name":"Aiden","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1431"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-19T13:33:21-07:00","id":561119,"title":"","content":"I hope they move it for <i>exactly</i> the same reason Twitch is saying.<br /> <br /> I've not fully warmed up to Beast, and it feels <i>really</i> &quot;in your face&quot; at the moment.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"ht